Timeline
========
mié ago 10 15:58:00 CEST 2011
Today we capture the neris bot along with the packets of the whole CTU department.
We used an XP virtualbox machine with the 147.32.84.165 public ip address.
The first hour of capture was only background and latter we run the malware until 5 minutes before ending.
We limited the bandwith of the experiment to 20kbps in the output of the bot.



Traffic Analysis
================
The bot sent spam, connected to IRC, and use HTTP to do some ClickFraud.

The first netflow record of the bot is:
